{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Mew Assistant",
    "description": "Modular assistant for special needs families supporting scheduling, tutoring, and caregiver summaries",
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "paths": {
    "/mew/session": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "sessions"
        ],
        "summary": "Create Session",
        "description": "Create a new session (tutoring, scheduling, or caregiver summary).\n\n**Priority escalation**: Automatically escalates priority during peak hours\n(morning prep, after-school, evening routine).\n\n**Example Request**:\n```json\n{\n    \"user_id\": \"user_12345\",\n    \"session_type\": \"tutoring\",\n    \"title\": \"Math homework help\",\n    \"priority\": \"normal\",\n    \"scheduled_at\": \"2025-11-15T14:00:00Z\"\n}\n```",
        "operationId": "create_session_mew_session_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SessionCreate"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SessionResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/mew/confirm": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "sessions"
        ],
        "summary": "Confirm Session",
        "description": "Confirm a session with cooldown protection.\n\n**Cooldown logic**: Prevents overwhelming families with requests.\n- Normal priority: 24-hour cooldown\n- High priority: 12-hour cooldown\n- Urgent: No cooldown\n\n**Override**: Use `override_cooldown=true` for urgent sessions.\n\n**Example Request**:\n```json\n{\n    \"session_id\": 42,\n    \"notes\": \"Confirmed via phone\",\n    \"override_cooldown\": false\n}\n```",
        "operationId": "confirm_session_mew_confirm_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SessionConfirm"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SessionResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
