    "/mew/ingest": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "messages"
        ],
        "summary": "Ingest Message",
        "description": "Ingest a message from any supported channel (email, SMS, WhatsApp).\n\n**Supported Channels**:\n- email: Email messages with subject and body\n- sms: Text messages from phone numbers\n- whatsapp: WhatsApp messages\n- web: Web form submissions\n\n**Example Request (Email)**:\n```json\n{\n    \"channel\": \"email\",\n    \"sender\": \"parent@example.com\",\n    \"recipient\": \"mew@assistant.com\",\n    \"subject\": \"Need tutoring help\",\n    \"body\": \"My child needs help with math homework.\",\n    \"session_id\": null\n}\n```\n\n**Example Request (SMS)**:\n```json\n{\n    \"channel\": \"sms\",\n    \"sender\": \"+1234567890\",\n    \"body\": \"Can we schedule a session for tomorrow?\",\n    \"session_id\": 42\n}\n```",
        "operationId": "ingest_message_mew_ingest_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MessageIngest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MessageResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/mew/ingest/batch": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "messages"
        ],
        "summary": "Ingest Batch",
        "description": "Ingest multiple messages in a single request.\n\n**Batch Size**: Maximum 100 messages per request.\n\n**Example Request**:\n```json\n{\n    \"messages\": [\n        {\n            \"channel\": \"email\",\n            \"sender\": \"parent1@example.com\",\n            \"body\": \"Need scheduling help\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"channel\": \"sms\",\n            \"sender\": \"+1234567890\",\n            \"body\": \"Thank you!\"\n        }\n    ]\n}\n```",
        "operationId": "ingest_batch_mew_ingest_batch_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MessageBatchIngest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "items": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MessageResponse"
                  },
                  "type": "array",
                  "title": "Response Ingest Batch Mew Ingest Batch Post"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
